stateDiagram-v2
%% Composite states: one keeping its own direction, one whose direction a
%% transition into a member gives up, nesting, a self-transition on a state
%% and on a composite, and a note on each side.

[*] --> Queued
Queued --> Queued : retry
Queued --> Batch
state Batch {
  direction LR
  Split --> Map
  Map --> Merge
}
Batch --> Batch : again
Batch --> Review
state Review {
  direction LR
  [*] --> Draft
  Draft --> Checked
  state Checked {
    Lint --> Test
  }
  Checked --> [*]
}
Queued --> Draft : shortcut
note right of Queued : waits for a free worker
Review --> Archive
note left of Archive : kept for a year
Archive --> [*]
